> Ilmari Karonen <usenet2@vyznev.invalid> wrote:
>> On 2009-04-26, Patric Mueller <bhaak@bigfoot.com> wrote:
>>>
>>> Something I've never seen an explanation for is that after killing a
>>> monster the player gains 4 times the experience points in score
